  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_01",
      "hash": "dc2609978ca2bbbb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨～！\\n未来的冠军！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_02",
      "hash": "dc260a978ca2bd6e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "枯叶市的道馆就在\\n前面这个方向！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_05",
      "hash": "dc260d978ca2c287",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要前往枯叶道馆，\\n就必须要[VAR COLOR(0006)]砍树[VAR COLOR(0000)]哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_06",
      "hash": "dc260e978ca2c43a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……你不知道怎么砍？\\c\\n嗯，我记得……\\n圣特安努号的船长\\r\\n应该十分了解砍树的方法……"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_03",
      "hash": "dc260b978ca2bf21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "枯叶市的道馆就在\\n前面这个方向！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_07",
      "hash": "dc260f978ca2c5ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要前往枯叶道馆，\\n就必须要[VAR COLOR(0006)]砍树[VAR COLOR(0000)]哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_08",
      "hash": "dc2600978ca2ac70",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不过……\\n现在的你和[VAR POKNAME(0002)]\\r\\n应该可以轻松做到吧！\\r\\n……你赶快试试看吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8025_gym_04",
      "hash": "dc260c978ca2c0d4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "干得漂亮！\\c\\n你[VAR COLOR(0006)]砍倒了树[VAR COLOR(0000)]，\\n开出了一条前往道馆的道路！[VAR SFX(0004)][VAR SFX(0001)]\\c\\n很好！这也同样使你\\n拥有了挑战道馆的资格！\\r\\n我在那里等着你！"
    }
